From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 17:13:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show the Slack Q on Boise-area beatdown cards

Boise regions sign up for the Q in Slack rather than on the F3 Nation
calendar, so the sweep only ever found their HC counts and the nearby
cards showed "3 HCs" with no Q, unlike every other region.

The Boise scraper exposes the Q line-up per AO and date, so fetch it for
today and tomorrow alongside the preblast summaries, translate the Slack
channel names ("old-glory", "otb-cynthia-mann") into the spoken names the
existing AO matcher understands, and set nextQ on the matched beatdowns.
The Q also counts toward the committed total, the same way the F3 Boise
app counts them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YT3ubrcTis7ctkWAXDLv49
